        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Devour the Living!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overlord’s Harvest is an incremental action game where you play as a demon lord harvesting souls from humans, dwarves, and elves. Move across the battlefield, unleash endless spells, and collect souls to grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Embrace the Darkness!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your harvested souls to unlock new talents. Each upgrade permanently strengthens your demonic power, letting you harvest faster and dominate harder with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Forge in Souls!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge strength through souls. Pour your harvest into weapon upgrades that permanently boost your attack power, letting you cut down enemies faster with each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Rule the Abyss!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your throne between harvests. Command your loyal servants, gaze upon your growing army, and prepare for the next wave of slaughter in your quest for dominance.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Devour the Living!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/bad936424e4cd3f0edbb3df8b59662cb.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overlord’s Harvest is an incremental action game where you play as a demon lord harvesting souls from humans, dwarves, and elves. Move across the battlefield, unleash endless spells, and collect souls to grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Embrace the Darkness!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/99f18f9362383f7b8b1efa3eaa956727.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your harvested souls to unlock new talents. Each upgrade permanently strengthens your demonic power, letting you harvest faster and dominate harder with every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Forge in Souls!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/8900ee943c404a31a60c2750dea478f2.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge strength through souls. Pour your harvest into weapon upgrades that permanently boost your attack power, letting you cut down enemies faster with each run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Rule the Abyss!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.poster.avif?t=1763726704\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.webm?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035610/extras/e0c5fe09bcc1db90a805963b82c83fc6.mp4?t=1763726704\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your throne between harvests. Command your loyal servants, gaze upon your growing army, and prepare for the next wave of slaughter in your quest for dominance.</p>",
        "short_description": "Overlord’s Harvest is an incremental action game where you slay humans, elves, and dwarves to gather souls. Spend them on talents, weapon upgrades, and the Maw, your idle soul engine, and grow stronger with every harvest. Will you claim the throne of the demon lord?",
